  "translation": "Kandi bizaba ⟨ni⟩ ko, niba wumva ⟨את⟩ ibyo byose ngutegeka, kandi utembera mu nzira zanjye, kandi ukore icyiza mu maso yanjye, mu kubungabunga amabwiriza yanjye n'amategeko yanjye, nko yakoze Dawidi, umugaragu wanjye, maze nzabe kumwe nawe, kandi nzubake ku wowe inzu izewe, nko nzubakiye Dawidi, kandi nzane ku wowe ⟨את⟩ Yisraeli;",
